# Local Workflow — CLI Commands

> **Visual flow diagrams:** [Local Dev Flow](agent-dev-local-flow.md) | [Automation Flow](agent-automation-flow.md) — mermaid diagrams showing the complete pipeline end-to-end.

All commands run in Claude Code (terminal) or as `@Agent` in VS Code Copilot chat.

## Quick Start

```
/agent-req <ID>    # Fetch ADO story, explain, research codebase
/agent-plan            # Generate step-by-step implementation plan
/agent-step-all        # Execute all steps (test + review + commit loop)
/agent-step-build      # Build & deploy
/agent-step-verify     # 6-phase verification
/agent-pr              # Create pull request
```

